      "analysis": "During a paranormal investigation in Tollygunge, Kolkata, Detectives of Supernatural captured an unusual dark, human-like figure in a photograph taken under UV (ultraviolet) light. The figure was not clearly identifiable at the time the image was captured and appeared distinctly different from the surrounding environment.\nThe photograph remains an unexplained visual anomaly documented during the investigation. While its origin cannot be conclusively established from the image alone, the capture has been preserved as part of the team’s field investigation records for further analysis and discussion.  -Team DOS",
      "analysisNotes": "During a paranormal investigation in Tollygunge, Kolkata, Detectives of Supernatural captured an unusual dark, human-like figure in a photograph taken under UV (ultraviolet) light. The figure was not clearly identifiable at the time the image was captured and appeared distinctly different from the surrounding environment.\nThe photograph remains an unexplained visual anomaly documented during the investigation. While its origin cannot be conclusively established from the image alone, the capture has been preserved as part of the team’s field investigation records for further analysis and discussion.  -Team DOS"
