      "status": "UNDER_INVESTIGATION",
      "category": "Photograph",
      "description": "During an investigation in Tollygunge, Kolkata, Detectives of Supernatural documented a striking facial anomaly in a photograph captured under UV light. The image appears to show a distorted or overlapping facial form across the face of the individual reported to be experiencing possession, while the faces of the other family members present in the same frame remained visually intact.\n\nThe unusual overlap was recorded during the investigation and is being treated as a photographic anomaly requiring further examination, rather than definitive proof of possession or a supernatural entity. The image remains part of the investigation documentation by Detectives of Supernatural.",
