      "description": "Step into the shadows with Detectives of Supernatural Investigation as we uncover the terrifying secrets of Benagram, known as the most haunted village of India, located in Asansol. 😱\nWith the support and permission of local police authorities, our team conducts a real, ground-level investigation into unexplained paranormal activities, chilling eyewitness accounts, and eerie locations that defy logic.",
