      "id": "med-2",
      "title": "GHOSTS - ARE N̶O̶T̶ REAL | PART 1",
      "publication": "Detectives Of Supernatural",
      "date": "2026-03-11",
      "category": "Youtube",
      "description": "Deep inside the dark and silent neighborhoods of Tollygunge, a terrifying case of *paranormal activity and suspected demonic possession* has left us in shock. What started as strange whispers, unexplained shadows, and violent disturbances inside a house soon turned into something far more horrifying.",
